# HY Mock Dev Flow

- Backend service lives in `HY_Online`, frontend app lives in `HY_APP`.
- Start mock backend in a dedicated terminal with `conda run -n ftapi python start.py`.
- Wait for `http://127.0.0.1:8000/health` to return 200 before launching frontend.
- In `HY_APP`, run `flutter pub get`, then `dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs`.
- Start frontend with `flutter run` (or `flutter run -d <deviceId>`).
- Keep backend and frontend in separate terminals during local development.
